    intro: ["Time to build something you could really use: a **playlist app** with a menu. Search for songs, add them, view the playlist with its total time, remove songs, and shuffle.", "You will build it from **small tested functions** and one **menu loop**. This is how real apps are made."],
    learn: ["functions that return values", "a menu loop with if / elif", "validating input with isdigit()", "a list of dictionaries that changes", "append, pop and shuffle"],
